#: dictee-setup.py:15228
msgid "Silence threshold:"
msgstr "Limiar de silêncio:"

#: dictee-setup.py:15229
msgid ""
"RMS level below which the recording is considered silent and transcription "
"is skipped. Prevents ASR hallucinations (parasitic phrases invented on "
